  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> be the <math><mi>x</mi></math> -intercept of line with slope <math><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mn>6</mn></math> respectively.<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi></math><br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi></mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Similarly <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi></mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Both <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfy <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math><br /><math><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math><br />And <math> <mrow> <mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><msub> <mi>C</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>⇒</mo><mn>6</mn><msub>&nbsp;<mi>C</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub> <mi>C</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow> </math><br />Hence, <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>160</mn></math>",
